<section class="border-ink-800 bg-ink-950 border-t px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="font-display text-ink-50 mb-8 text-center text-2xl font-semibold md:text-3xl">
      Get started
    </h2>
    <div class="border-ink-800 bg-ink-900 mb-8 rounded-xl border p-6">
      <h3 class="text-ink-50 mb-4 font-semibold">Install</h3>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div>
          <p class="text-ink-400 mb-1 text-xs font-medium tracking-wider uppercase">
            npm (recommended)
          </p>
          <div class="bg-ink-950 text-ink-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-sm">
            <span class="text-ink-500 select-none" aria-hidden="true">$ </span>npm install --global
            nestweaver
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-ink-400 text-sm">
          Needs Node.js 18+ on macOS 13.3+ or Linux with glibc 2.35+ (x86_64 or arm64). Or download
          a checksummed <a
            href="https://github.com/Kehl-io/nestweaver/releases"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-cobalt hover:text-halo underline underline-offset-2">release archive</a
          > and keep the extracted folder intact: Linux archives ship a <code class="text-ink-200"
            >lib/</code
          > runtime next to the binary. See the <a
            href="https://docs.nestweaver.kehl.io/getting-started/"
            class="text-cobalt hover:text-halo underline underline-offset-2">install guide</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="border-ink-800 bg-ink-900 mb-8 rounded-xl border p-6">
      <h3 class="text-ink-50 mb-4 font-semibold">Setup + first index</h3>
      <div class="bg-ink-950 text-ink-100 space-y-1 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm">
        <div>
          <span class="text-ink-500 select-none" aria-hidden="true">$ </span>nestweaver setup <span
            class="text-ink-500 ml-2"># connects your AI tools</span
          >
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-ink-500 select-none" aria-hidden="true">$ </span>nestweaver index --repo
          . <span class="text-ink-500 ml-2"># parses your codebase</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="border-ink-800 bg-ink-900 mb-8 rounded-xl border p-6">
      <h3 class="text-ink-50 mb-2 font-semibold">Upgrading to 12.2.2</h3>
      <p class="text-ink-400 mb-4 text-sm">
        12.2.2 changes how calls and imports resolve (resolver generation 12) and how vault links
        are derived. Re-index each repository once, and refresh each vault:
      </p>
      <div class="bg-ink-950 text-ink-100 space-y-1 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm">
        <div>
          <span class="text-ink-500 select-none" aria-hidden="true">$ </span>nestweaver index --repo
          &lt;path&gt; --force
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-ink-500 select-none" aria-hidden="true">$ </span>nestweaver brain
          refresh &lt;vault&gt;
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-ink-400 mt-3 text-sm">
        A plain <code class="text-ink-200">index</code> is not enough: the repo is already at HEAD, so
        nothing gets rewritten. <a
          href="https://docs.nestweaver.kehl.io/cli/indexing/#upgrading-to-1222"
          class="text-cobalt hover:text-halo underline underline-offset-2">Upgrade details</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center">
      <a
        href="https://docs.nestweaver.kehl.io/getting-started/"
        class="bg-cobalt text-ink-950 hover:bg-halo focus-visible:outline-halo inline-flex rounded-lg px-8 py-3 font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3"
        >Read the full guide</a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
